-  borrowers get 15% / 25 years.
+- IBR is priced at 15% / 25 years when any listed loan was paid out before
+  July 1, 2014, and at 10% / 20 years otherwise. An older loan that is not
+  listed, for example one repaid by a later consolidation, cannot be seen.
 - The Graduated step schedule is a model; regulation caps the largest payment at
   three times the smallest but servicers set the exact steps.
 
